                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I used to have one of the highest rated and most comprehensive reviews on Egress, but sadly the game has been [b][u]completely and wholeheartedly abandoned[/u][/b] for years by now.\n\nChanging the rating would just wipe the stats on this into obscurity, but I [b][u]would not recommend even if it were free[/u][/b], and I'm not sure the servers even still exist.\n\nAvoid this game and the developer (Fazan).\n\nIt hurts me to write this because back in its time, Egress was really a promising candidate with a novel take on souls-like PvP (something something Nightreign) but I can not stand with the prior review any longer.",
